{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79328,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c0aa4839863a228cfc48b66ccf2036c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RitvikSehgal\" post=\"1901878\" timestamp=\"1438760766\"]\ni have spend about 80K only on the gifts which are given to about 20 bridesmaids at the day of weeding. so it totally depends upon the budget u take in. so do what even u feel good.[\/quote]80k?? What currency are we talking here. That&#039;s more than a lot make in a year at work!!! :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901885,"PostDate":1438776245,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RitvikSehgal, on 04 August 2015 - 11:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>i have spend about 80K only on the gifts which are given to about 20 bridesmaids at the day of weeding. so it totally depends upon the budget u take in. so do what even u feel good.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n80k?? What currency are we talking here. That's more than a lot make in a year at work!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.233.200.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79328,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1883ad92b3091631246d904f380d4b50","RawContent":"Hi just wondering where you got the robes??  I have seen a lot of talk on hear about robes and tropical robes\nthanks![quote name=\"rachelia160\" post=\"1899473\" timestamp=\"1435588874\"]\nI bought my girls their jewelry, getting ready robes, a beach bag, a wet bikini bag, tank tops, and an Alex and Ani bracelet as their actual \"gift\" (I might be forgetting some things), but it probably added up to about $130 per bridesmaid (I had 5). I wish I could have done more, but they were all overwhelmed that I even did that much and were so grateful and appreciative. I would do what you can, but don&#039;t feel like you have to break the bank for them - I&#039;m sure they wouldn&#039;t want you to stress over money for stuff for them with all the other wedding expenses.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1902063,"PostDate":1438929456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi just wondering where you got the robes??\u00a0 I have seen a lot of talk on hear about robes and tropical robes<\/p>\n<p>thanks!<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelia160, on 29 June 2015 - 06:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I bought my girls their jewelry, getting ready robes, a beach bag, a wet bikini bag, tank tops, and an Alex and Ani bracelet as their actual \"gift\" (I might be forgetting some things), but it probably added up to about $130 per bridesmaid (I had 5). I wish I could have done more, but they were all overwhelmed that I even did that much and were so grateful and appreciative. I would do what you can, but don't feel like you have to break the bank for them - I'm sure they wouldn't want you to stress over money for stuff for them with all the other wedding expenses.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#cc6666;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><em>Forever can never be long enough for me, to feel like I've had long enough with you...19\/01\/2016<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kimberlydiana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412304687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimmyd2","Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79328,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62bff62385048cc469cea16d243c0413","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kimmyd2\" post=\"1902063\" timestamp=\"1438929456\"]\nHi just wondering where you got the robes??  I have seen a lot of talk on hear about robes and tropical robes\nthanks![\/quote]\nI got them from Etsy: [url=\"https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/transaction\/258177006\"]https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/transaction\/258177006[\/url]\n\nThey weren&#039;t the very best quality in the whole world as far as the material, but they looked great in pictures and were the cheapest ones I could find! If you go with these, keep in mind that the shipping is from Thailand though so it takes a few weeks.\n\n[img]https:\/\/scontent.fdtw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11659321_10155723392400293_7524350414732123856_n.jpg?oh=17ab71c561c92978b03b32f8155fa3b2&amp;amp;oe=563694BC[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1902220,"PostDate":1439221673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kimmyd2, on 06 August 2015 - 10:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi just wondering where you got the robes??\u00a0 I have seen a lot of talk on hear about robes and tropical robes<\/p>\n<p>thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got them from Etsy:\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/transaction\/258177006' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ction\/258177006<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They weren't the very best quality in the whole world as far as the material, but they looked great in pictures and were the cheapest ones I could find! If you go with these, keep in mind that the shipping is from Thailand though so it takes a few weeks.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.fdtw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11659321_10155723392400293_7524350414732123856_n.jpg?oh=17ab71c561c92978b03b32f8155fa3b2&oe=563694BC\" alt=\"11659321_10155723392400293_7524350414732\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388731897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"87.149.190.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79328,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0375a39fab503cabc48e17dc2eea3b3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;No more than $200 p.b.m&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905383,"PostDate":1443169257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>No more than $200 p.b.m<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jammyandy89@outlook.de","IpAddress":"87.149.190.66","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443011300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"IggyPop","Id":284905,"Name":"IggyPop","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
