> Time: 1455726272 / Wed, 17 Feb 2016 16:24:32 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=79905&SessionId=501e3b5b0c38b7eae5c0784b09e6acb2
> User soon2bmrswoods (286219)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ce302a0f89e79943e57349fb80daaeb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Are anyone else&#039;s guests panicking over the Zika Virus?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/wwwnc.cdc.gov\/travel\/notices\/alert\/zika-virus-mexico&#039;&gt;http:\/\/wwwnc.cdc.gov\/travel\/notices\/alert\/zika-virus-mexico&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s of course very serious and something to be very aware of, but I&#039;ve actually had one of my friend&#039;s who is already booked and paid post numerous articles on facebook about the virus and another about Air Canada (the airline we are flying) issuing refunds for flights... She&#039;s a nurse and I understand her worry but I hope it doesn&#039;t cause panic and encourage my guests to cancel.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone else dealing with this? &amp;nbsp;And any tips for how to speak to you guests about this?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910223,"PostDate":1454091729,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Are anyone else's guests panicking over the Zika Virus?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/wwwnc.cdc.gov\/travel\/notices\/alert\/zika-virus-mexico' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/wwwnc.cdc.gov...ka-virus-mexico<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's of course very serious and something to be very aware of, but I've actually had one of my friend's who is already booked and paid post numerous articles on facebook about the virus and another about Air Canada (the airline we are flying) issuing refunds for flights... She's a nurse and I understand her worry but I hope it doesn't cause panic and encourage my guests to cancel.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else dealing with this? \u00a0And any tips for how to speak to you guests about this?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b355ef4985186b9aabe56697bb6d179","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deecol\"] This is what has been floating around the Azul Fives Brides lately re: Zika Virus (not sure what the source of this is though):&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(246,247,248);\"&gt;Zika virus hasn&#039;t been found in Quintana Roo (the state in which Riviera Maya and Cancun is located). More info: In Late 2015, 2 cases of \u201cZika Virus\u201d infection were identified in the country of Mexico. The cases were found in a resident of Nuevo Le\u00f3n,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(246,247,248);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;located over 2000 km (1,242 miles) away from Quintana Roo and in Chiapas, located over 1100km (683) away from Quintana Roo.\n\nWe can confirm that there has not been any other case reported elsewhere in Mexico. Cancun, the Riviera Maya and the State of Quintana Roo remain free from the \u201cZika Virus\u201d.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(246,247,248);\"&gt;All our hotels in Riviera Maya make every effort to eliminate and control the mosquito; we follow preventative measures set by the WHO and CDC as well as the local governing body. We have a full fumigation program that has been in place and proved successful for many years; this includes daily, weekly and monthly fumigation tasks in public areas of the hotel, guest rooms and facilities. In addition mosquito repellent is ready available throughout all restaurants and bars, and for our guest comfort and wellbeing all guests\u2019 rooms are air conditioned as well as the many of the public areas and facilities within the resorts.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910224,"PostDate":1454092213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> This is what has been floating around the Azul Fives Brides lately re: Zika Virus (not sure what the source of this is though):<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\">Zika virus hasn't been found in Quintana Roo (the state in which Riviera Maya and Cancun is located). More info: In Late 2015, 2 cases of \u201cZika Virus\u201d infection were identified in the country of Mexico. The cases were found in a resident of Nuevo Le\u00f3n,<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\">\u00a0located over 2000 km (1,242 miles) away from Quintana Roo and in Chiapas, located over 1100km (683) away from Quintana Roo.<br>\nWe can confirm that there has not been any other case reported elsewhere in Mexico. Cancun, the Riviera Maya and the State of Quintana Roo remain free from the \u201cZika Virus\u201d.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\">All our hotels in Riviera Maya make every effort to eliminate and control the mosquito; we follow preventative measures set by the WHO and CDC as well as the local governing body. We have a full fumigation program that has been in place and proved successful for many years; this includes daily, weekly and monthly fumigation tasks in public areas of the hotel, guest rooms and facilities. In addition mosquito repellent is ready available throughout all restaurants and bars, and for our guest comfort and wellbeing all guests\u2019 rooms are air conditioned as well as the many of the public areas and facilities within the resorts.<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415547511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8b7aa300f70b8643768bcad84105e90","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"snswedding2016\"] Thank you! That is really reassuring to read! &amp;nbsp;If you find the source please let me know so I can let my guests know&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910225,"PostDate":1454092424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> Thank you! That is really reassuring to read! \u00a0If you find the source please let me know so I can let my guests know\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00fce3825b06f9a77eaec71302673c7f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deecol\"] will do! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910227,"PostDate":1454093064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> will do! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415547511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1454095752,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b54eaf2cef7418b1efc54290e2da4d37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"snswedding2016\"] I just posted the first paragraph in my wedding facebook group and on our website, thanks again for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910230,"PostDate":1454095739,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> I just posted the first paragraph in my wedding facebook group and on our website, thanks again for sharing!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.29.247.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5686013c368bc5ec6a843696fa0ae6e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I had one guest cancel the trip - but she is pregnant. It really only negatively affects pregnant women, or those trying to get pregnant. otherwise you may just experience a fever or pink eye, but this virus has been around for a long time. Only recently has it been found to cause birth defects. So pregnant women are urged to not travel to the impacted countries. If you are not pregnant and get the virus, you can have healthy babies again once the virus is out of your system.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910235,"PostDate":1454103894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I had one guest cancel the trip - but she is pregnant. It really only negatively affects pregnant women, or those trying to get pregnant. otherwise you may just experience a fever or pink eye, but this virus has been around for a long time. Only recently has it been found to cause birth defects. So pregnant women are urged to not travel to the impacted countries. If you are not pregnant and get the virus, you can have healthy babies again once the virus is out of your system.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maria.anisimova88@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.29.247.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420724999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281640.jpg?_r=1446819439","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"maria1488","Id":281640,"Name":"maria1488","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"39.248.150.227","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6df459bab26d3a7b8fb8a38a9ce9d47","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;ya, i heard a lot about it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;it&#039;s so scary&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910251,"PostDate":1454112313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>ya, i heard a lot about it.<\/p>\n<p>it's so scary<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430664822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.66.81","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12d8483d6c561693e907954e94062c28","RawContent":"Here is an article from CBC. Apparently the risk is still considered low for travellers. \n\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.cbc.ca\/beta\/news\/world\/zika-virus-what-canadians-travellers-need-to-know-1.3424064&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.cbc.ca\/beta\/news\/world\/zika-virus-what-canadians-travellers-need-to-know-1.3424064&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910305,"PostDate":1454200044,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is an article from CBC. Apparently the risk is still considered low for travellers. <br><br>\n<a href='http:\/\/www.cbc.ca\/beta\/news\/world\/zika-virus-what-canadians-travellers-need-to-know-1.3424064' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.cbc.ca\/be...-know-1.3424064<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415547511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.177.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"401b2ff45539533a1dc3778c5319fb14","RawContent":"I&#039;m worried about it affecting attendance at my Dec wedding as well.  I thought I read in an article that if a normal person gets it, they recover in a few days and it&#039;s not a big deal.  However,  for pregnant women, it&#039;s a different story.  I&#039;m really hoping it&#039;s not an issue in December.  One of my bridesmaids is talking about having another baby soon, so I might lose her now.\n\n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1910309,"PostDate":1454254848,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm worried about it affecting attendance at my Dec wedding as well.  I thought I read in an article that if a normal person gets it, they recover in a few days and it's not a big deal.  However,  for pregnant women, it's a different story.  I'm really hoping it's not an issue in December.  One of my bridesmaids is talking about having another baby soon, so I might lose her now.<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tpenner@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"68.150.177.36","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1451960069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285764.jpg?_r=1451960071","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tpenner","Id":285764,"Name":"tpenner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79905,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63ee08eb13b1867b8273344252c7676b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tpenner\" post=\"1910309\" timestamp=\"1454254848\"]\nI&#039;m worried about it affecting attendance at my Dec wedding as well.  I thought I read in an article that if a normal person gets it, they recover in a few days and it&#039;s not a big deal.  However,  for pregnant women, it&#039;s a different story.  I&#039;m really hoping it&#039;s not an issue in December.  One of my bridesmaids is talking about having another baby soon, so I might lose her now.\n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk[\/quote]If she wants to conceive soon you may lose her anyways. She&#039;d be due late this year and may not want to travel with a young baby or leave them at home!!!\n\nPregnancy and destination weddings are a tricky one :( \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1910310,"PostDate":1454255619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tpenner, on 31 January 2016 - 07:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm worried about it affecting attendance at my Dec wedding as well.  I thought I read in an article that if a normal person gets it, they recover in a few days and it's not a big deal.  However,  for pregnant women, it's a different story.  I'm really hoping it's not an issue in December.  One of my bridesmaids is talking about having another baby soon, so I might lose her now.<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nIf she wants to conceive soon you may lose her anyways. She'd be due late this year and may not want to travel with a young baby or leave them at home!!!<br><br>\nPregnancy and destination weddings are a tricky one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":34,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
